{"product_id":"m-series-safety-frame-kit-prescription-ready","title":"M-Series Safety Frame Kit (Prescription Ready)","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eM-Series safety frames include left and right side clips with the custom Vuzix rail mounting system, allowing for right or left eye mounting with 30 degree rotation of the M-Series Smart Glasses main unit. Shipped with prescription blanks, these frames can be fitted for safety rated prescriptions by most optometrists. Additional accessories include a comfort nose bridge, dust guard, and temple head strap for a snug fit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cem\u003eSmart Glasses not included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Small","offer_id":40865743569062,"sku":"446T0A022","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Medium","offer_id":40865743601830,"sku":"446T0A001","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Large","offer_id":40865743634598,"sku":"446T0A023","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/products\/M-Series-Safety-Frame-Kit.png?v=1628086990","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/m-series-safety-frame-kit-prescription-ready","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}